'''Tinkatuff''' (Japanese: '''ナカヌチャン''' ''Nakanuchan'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

